msgid "Use the duplicated context in virtual threads"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Methods annotated with `@RunOnVirtualThread` inherit from the original "
"duplicated context (See the xref:duplicated-context.adoc[duplicated context "
"reference guide] for details).\n"
"So, the data written in the duplicated context (and the request scope, as "
"the request scoped is stored in the duplicated context) by filters and "
"interceptors are available during the method execution (even if the filters "
"and interceptors are not run on the virtual thread)."
msgstr ""

msgid "However, thread locals are not propagated."
msgstr ""

